ADDITIONAL NOTICES

Trademarks
    "Elgato", "Wave", "Wave:3" and "Wave Link" are trademarks of Corsair
    Gaming, Inc. and its affiliates. This project is not affiliated with,
    authorised by, endorsed by, or sponsored by Corsair or Elgato. Those names
    appear here only to identify the hardware this software works with.

No third-party code or assets
    This repository contains no Elgato or Corsair source code, binaries,
    firmware, artwork, or other assets. Everything here was written from
    scratch.

Interoperability
    The USB control protocol implemented here was determined by observing a
    device the author owns and by analysing a freely downloadable application,
    for the sole purpose of making that hardware work on Linux - a platform the
    vendor does not support. No copy protection was circumvented. In the EU
    this is expressly permitted by Article 6 of Directive 2009/24/EC; in the US
    it is consistent with 17 U.S.C. Sec. 1201(f).

Hardware risk
    Writing to a USB device carries inherent risk. Configuration writes here
    are transactional and verified, and the firmware-update (DFU) interface is
    never accessed, but the Software is provided without warranty as stated
    above. Use of it may affect your hardware warranty.

Dependencies
    The Software depends on, but does not redistribute, PipeWire, WirePlumber,
    GTK4, libadwaita and the LSP Plugins (LGPL-3.0). Install those through your
    distribution.
